{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_01_f",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:92f5643fdf7f0bae8066a8c7fb603a7146e2052749daae25d4cead580a1f32e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000022:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64abcda397e8b77e566b3abc0ee5569df237185fd6035ca25707f5c27c31bf89",
      "text": "……事情就是这样。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0bcb49e7fce7028a7ebc470b87410ff950406561bdb14c9d2e3ea6301a729a7c",
      "text": "居然有这种事……\n而且大家也都收到了同样的信。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e6937a0dcf11ca9cb8fa31f7316f44856dd45f63f3b57b9e0a3d83696dbccb8a",
      "text": "我是在散步时，被黑衣男子当面递交的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7103f11cfcbd05fb86af442085ba367249b946711df0b2758baad025acea54b",
      "text": "我的话，是夹在掉在路边的赛马杂志里哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab6f3306bb25b8feff00d6fc097b5342208a59f0d823b7271f2b894a8144ee2a",
      "text": "我家则是从窗户飞进了一只纸飞机。\n还真是古风的递交方式啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76b1a746ed8879db15c7a7a2b540abeb28444e0b9a5c28ad23bad09456511e93",
      "text": "从信的内容与字迹推断，恐怕寄信人和\n之前给我们送来挑战书的是同一人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ab82257d1b3fa864120ff6d2e1537dcd487fc325c4f5a584c1fe07226227d1e",
      "text": "“态度真是游刃有余啊，\n315 Production！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00f3539771eed6c0eba6d2c899011db59cfbada81040de3957d326e02680a41b",
      "text": "“在男极可就不会这样了。定要全力将你们\n打得落花流水，洗干净脖子等着吧！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84318faeaf5928bb551656dc2f81fedd17f2f7f7e41fb9b824b16dc2dafa0ccc",
      "text": "……每一封信上，都写着这些内容。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_01:1_4_002_01_f:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1564773ccfff832d3706f20b77dd19c63bb3da958f2103f5150109ec85051e26",
      "text": "游刃有余……\n难不成，是指昨晚的事？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
